+
+## Metrics History (`/api/measures/search_history`)
+
+### Parameters
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+| --------- | ----------- |
+| `component` | Project key |
+| `metrics` | Metric keys |
+| `from` / `to` | Date range (`YYYY-MM-DD`) |
+| `branch` | Branch name |
+| `p` / `ps` | Pagination |
+
