+
+## Quality Profiles (`/api/qualityprofiles/search`)
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+| --------- | ----------- |
+| `language` | Filter by language |
+| `project` | Project key |
+| `qualityProfile` | Profile name |
+
+```bash
